==English==
[[File:Rio Grande do Sul in Brazil.svg|thumb|Rio Grande do Sul, Brazil]]

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|pt|Rio Grande do Sul|lit=Great River of the South}}. {{m|pt|Rio Grande|t=Great River}} is an old name for the [[Lagoa dos Patos]] lagoon, and the southern attribution contrasts with [[Rio Grande do Norte]].

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|nolinkhead=1}}

# {{place|en|state|r/South Region|c/Brazil|capital=Porto Alegre}}

